Please note that names of those variables are the heart and soul of
Lojban.  They are the true grammar, not any words like "predicates" or
"verbs" or "nouns".

So names of those variables should be Lojbanic words or expressions
otherwise we could just say {.ge'u'elidibel.}
It's not the true programmers' problem "How do I choose name of variables".
It's about how in future we'll describe the language e.g. in jbo-CLL.


